<%# Collision handling. The trigger is pinned to the bottom of the frame, so the
    popover has no room below and flips above it. Above the trigger the popover
    is pinned at its bottom edge, so the calendar moves the month header there:
    February 2026 has 4 weeks, March 5, May 6, and the arrows stay put while
    the height changes. The docs iframe is sized to make the flip happen -- see
    the height on the preview tag in docs/date_picker.md. %>
<div class="flex flex-col justify-end" style="min-height: 25rem;">
  <p data-form-part="description" class="mb-2">
    This trigger sits at the bottom of the frame, so the calendar opens above it,
    with the month and arrows next to the trigger.
  </p>

  <%= render "components/date_picker",
        mode: :single,
        selected: Date.new(2026, 2, 10),
        input_name: "renewal_date" %>
</div>
